{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_056F50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"看起来你和Cécile在那个<R=研究设施,LAB>里相处得挺愉快啊。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=研究设施,LAB>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什……别说得那么难听。我只是不能让她知道秘密，所以才没办法……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"就连洗澡，你也没必要特地替她洗吧。让她自己进去，从外面锁门不就行了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"那是……因为她看起来很不安，所以，那个……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"你不是反而让她更不安了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"她很美。我只是赞美了她的美。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"她可是吓得够呛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我没伤害她。她自己应该也明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"可她觉得有生命危险，才逃走了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"先不说我，要是被Coldman发现，还不知道会遭到什么……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是啊。其实我也想帮她。但我不能以放弃完成Mammal为代价。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以你故意制造了方便她逃走的条件？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你觉得我有那么善良吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……不过，确实，我没有严加看守。她要逃出建筑应该很容易。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"但她出去以后似乎反而更辛苦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"总之，我没对她做过任何值得被责怪的事。明白了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"嗯，这一点我相信。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}